{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03911","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 阎朝隐","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金台隐隐陵黄道，玉辇亭亭下绦雰。\n千种冈峦千种树，一重岩壑一重云。\n花落风吹红的历，藤垂日晃绿葐蒀。\n五百里内贤人聚，愿陪阊阖侍天文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎朝隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}